Or just #name your (item) with the turn number when you last prayed.

pray.c will show you that u.ublesscnt is rnz(350); the rnz() function is
explained in detail on Wikihack, along with a nice graph of the curve.

Probability for any given turn-count beyond that (item) can be derived 
from that, as well as the maximum reasonable output from rnz(350) -- so
you can know whether it's "likely" safe to pray in most cases, and when
it will be "definitely" safe to pray.

It isn't rocket science unless you go out of your way to make it so.

